   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Centro de Documentaci&#xF3;n de Honduras (CEDOH) was founded in 1980 and work with research, investigation and publication of studies to promote dialogue within society on relevant democratic issues, with an important experience of the transition from authoritarian military rule to democracy and respect for human rights during the last decades. Now bridge agreement for imp. of inst plan 2008-2010.</narrative>
